=== Episode 4: Batter ===
The first task was to make 24 [[yorkshire pudding]]s in 2 hours.  The bakers used the standard recipe filled with a variety of savory ingredients and flavors. The technical challenge gave the bakers 1 hour to make 12 heart-shaped "lace" [[pancake]]s, which required them to draw a heart-shaped design with the batter. They were only allowed 1 practice pancake.  The showstopper challenge was to make 36 sweet [[churro]]s in 3 hours.{{sticky header}}{{table alignment}}
