=== Episode 5: Pastry ===
For the signature bake, bakers were tasked with baking 24 [[Danish pastry|breakfast pastries]], using 2 different batches of dough (total 12 each) in {{frac|3|1|2}} hours. The technical challenge required the bakers to make a feathered [[Bakewell tart]] in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were challenged to make 48 filled [[filo]] [[amuse-bouche]]; 24 with a savoury filling and 24 with a sweet filling, in 4 hours.{{table alignment}}
